---
import RatedBadge from "../components/RatedBadge.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="How We Work | Otter Homecare" description="Our simple, reassuring process — from first call to ongoing care.">
<header class="phero"><div class="wrap"><div class="crumb"><a href="/">Home</a> · How We Work</div><h1>A simple, reassuring process</h1><p>From your first call to ongoing support, here's how we get to know you and build care around your life.</p></div></header>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="steps-grid"><div class="step reveal"><span class="step-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1 1 .4 1.9.7 2.8a2 2 0 0 1-.4 2.1L8 9.9a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.8.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.8 2z"></path></svg><span class="step-num">1</span></span><h3>Call us</h3><p>Complimentary, expert guidance tailored to your needs.</p></div> <div class="step reveal"><span class="step-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"></path><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"></path></svg><span class="step-num">2</span></span><h3>Home visit</h3><p>Our qualified manager visits to create your tailored care plan.</p></div> <div class="step reveal"><span class="step-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 0L12 5.7l-1-1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 7.8l1 1L12 21l7.8-7.6 1-1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.8z"></path></svg><span class="step-num">3</span></span><h3>Start care</h3><p>Your matched Care Professional begins support on your terms.</p></div> <div class="step reveal"><span class="step-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M23 4v6h-6"></path><path d="M1 20v-6h6"></path><path d="M3.5 9a9 9 0 0 1 14.8-3.4L23 10M1 14l4.7 4.4A9 9 0 0 0 20.5 15"></path></svg><span class="step-num">4</span></span><h3>Ongoing</h3><p>We review and adapt your care as your needs change.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section bg-sky" style="padding-top:44px;padding-bottom:64px"><div class="wrap"><div class="ww-photos reveal"><figure class="ww-photo"><span class="ww-note">a familiar face, every visit<svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 3 C 15 13 24 21 30 33" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.8" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M30 33 L 20.5 30.5 M30 33 L 27.5 22.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.8" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span><img src="/img/ww-visit.jpg" alt="An Otter Care Professional with a client at home"></figure><figure class="ww-photo r"><span class="ww-note"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M32 3 C 25 13 16 21 10 33" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.8" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M10 33 L 19.5 30.5 M10 33 L 12.5 22.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.8" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>good enough for my own dad</span><img src="/img/founder-dad.jpg" alt="Jamie, our founder, with his father" loading="lazy"></figure></div></div></section><section class="section bg-beige"><div class="wrap"><div class="head-c reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Why families choose us</span><h2>What makes us different</h2></div><div class="perks-grid reveal"><div class="perk"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/heart.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><h3>Good enough for Dad</h3><p>We only hire Care Professionals we'd trust to look after our own families — in fact, our team supports Jamie's own dad.</p></div><div class="perk"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/team.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><h3>A small, dedicated team</h3><p>We keep our team tight-knit, so Care Professionals really get to know each client and their family.</p></div><div class="perk"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/pin.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><h3>Local and personal</h3><p>We're based in Trowbridge and just around the corner — always close by and ready to help.</p></div><div class="perk"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/phone.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><h3>Care app for transparency</h3><p>Family members see real-time updates from every visit, for total peace of mind.</p></div><div class="perk"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/clock.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><h3>Visits that suit you</h3><p>From a quick check-in to a full day together — care that flexes around your life, never rushed.</p></div><div class="perk"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/mug.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><h3>Otter Happy Hour</h3><p>Every client gets a free hour of care each month to enjoy something special, just for them.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section bg-cream tmt"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px"><div class="head-c reveal"><h2>What to expect</h2></div><ul class="checklist reveal"><li>A free, no-obligation home visit</li><li>A care plan built around your routine</li><li>Care Professionals carefully matched to you</li><li>A small, familiar team — not strangers</li><li>Real-time updates via our Care App</li><li>Regular reviews as needs change</li></ul></div></section>
<section class="section bg-sky"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px;text-align:center"><div class="reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Our "Good Enough for Dad" promise</span><h2 style="font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,38px);margin:10px 0 14px">If our care is good enough for my own family, it's good enough for yours</h2><blockquote style="font-family:'Spectral';font-style:italic;font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink);max-width:34ch;margin:0 auto">When my dad had a stroke, I saw first-hand how important the right care is. Today, our Care Professionals support him with the same patience and compassion they bring to every client.</blockquote><div style="margin-top:16px;font-weight:800">Jamie Rowland-Jones <span style="display:block;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted)">Founder, Otter Homecare</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section bg-beige"><div class="wrap"><div class="head-c reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Your care journey</span><h2>One care journey, one trusted team</h2><p class="lede" style="margin:10px auto 0;max-width:64ch"><strong>You don't have to plan everything today.</strong> When you start with Otter, you're not just arranging support for now — you're choosing a care partner for every stage, whatever the future brings. Needs change; that's a normal part of life. What matters is knowing you won't have to switch provider, start again, or make rushed decisions if they do.</p></div><div class="journey-grid reveal"><div class="jstage"><span class="jnum">1</span><h3>Start small, at your own pace</h3><p>Friendly companionship and conversation, light housework or laundry, help getting out and about, a regular reassuring visit.</p><p class="jnote">No pressure to do more than feels right.</p><div class="jlevel"><span class="jl-bars"><i></i><i class="off"></i><i class="off"></i></span><span class="jl-label">A little support</span></div></div><div class="jstage"><span class="jnum">2</span><h3>Care that can grow with you</h3><p>As needs increase we gently adapt — personal care, medication assistance, morning/evening or multiple daily visits.</p><p class="jnote">Your care evolves; your relationship with us stays the same.</p><div class="jlevel"><span class="jl-bars"><i></i><i></i><i class="off"></i></span><span class="jl-label">More each day</span></div></div><div class="jstage"><span class="jnum">3</span><h3>Staying home, even if care becomes more complex</h3><p>If staying safely at home needs more, we also provide <a href="/live-in-care">live-in care</a> — 24-hour, one-to-one support in your own home, a genuine alternative to moving into a care home.</p><p class="jnote">Many families don't realise this option exists until decisions feel rushed.</p><div class="jlevel"><span class="jl-bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="jl-label">Round-the-clock</span></div></div></div><p class="reveal" style="text-align:center;max-width:62ch;margin:30px auto 0;font-size:17px;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6">Because we already know you and what matters to you, we can talk calmly about next steps <strong>before</strong> things feel urgent. You don't have to decide anything now — just know that whatever happens, <strong>we've got your back.</strong></p></div></section>
<section class="section bg-sky"><div class="wrap"><div class="mca-split reveal"><div class="mca-media"><img src="/img/visiting-real.jpg" alt="An Otter Care Professional warmly greeting a client at her front door" loading="lazy"></div><div class="mca-body"><span class="eyebrow">Your decisions, your way</span><h2 style="font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,36px);margin:8px 0 12px">Care that protects dignity and choice</h2><p class="lede" style="margin:0 0 14px">We're committed to care that protects dignity and choice, so we always support people to make their own decisions — and we respect consent, every single visit.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:22px">It's not red tape — it's how we keep care respectful, lawful and genuinely protective, for clients and families alike.</p><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/post/mental-capacity-act">Read more: the Mental Capacity Act, explained simply →</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px"><div class="head-c reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Always here</span><h2>A real person at the end of the phone — day or night</h2></div><div class="reveal" style="max-width:64ch;margin:0 auto"><p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:14px">We answer our own phone, day and night — never a call centre.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px">One evening an anxious client rang our on-call line; our Registered Manager came out in person to reassure him while we arranged the help he needed. That's the difference between a rota and a relationship.</p><p style="color:var(--muted)"><strong>A deliberately strong office team.</strong> For our size, we've built a strong office and leadership team — a Registered Manager, Coordinator, Supervisor and a dedicated Trainer — because that's what protects quality and stops the corner-cutting that creeps in when teams scale thin.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section book"><div class="wrap" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;display:block;text-align:center"><div class="reveal" style="max-width:36ch;margin:0 auto"><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#9fc4bf">Free, no-obligation assessment</span><h2 style="margin:14px 0 12px">Let's find the right care, together</h2><p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:26px;color:#bfe0dc">Speak to a real, local person today — never a call centre.</p><div style="display:flex;gap:13px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn btn-clay btn-lg" href="/contact">Book a free assessment</a><a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="tel:01225690022" style="background:transparent;color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.5)">Call 01225 690022</a></div></div><div class="book-trust reveal"><div class="bt-ticks"><span>Free, no-obligation home visit</span><span>A care plan built around you</span><span>We usually reply the same day</span></div><RatedBadge /></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
